    "long_instructions": "# Reflection\r\n\r\nContent Creation\r\nWriting Assistance\r\nLesson Planning\r\nPersonalized Learning\r\nLanguage Translation\r\nFeedback Generation\r\nLanguage Translation\r\nAutomatic Grading\r\nAdministrative Tasks\r\n\r\n#### Thinking about the ways to use generative AI in the previous level, what WON'T you use it for in your classroom? And/Or what are you worried your students will use it for that you’d rather they didn’t?\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;\">\r\n    <summary style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;\">📝 Share in the forum!\r\n</summary>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;\">\r\n    <p>\r\n\r\n####Participating in the <a href=\"https://forum.code.org/c/ai-cs/ai-101-self-paced-pl-community/477\" target=\"_blank\">AI 101 Self-Paced PL Community</a> is optional and not necessary to earn a certificate for this module. However, we encourage you to engage with the broader AI 101 learner community. Please share your response to this reflection in the forum and take the time to read and respond to other educators' posts.\r\n\r\n### <a href=\"https://forum.code.org/t/module-2-level-17-reflection-generative-ai-in-the-classroom/39649\" target=\"_blank\">Direct Link to this Forum Topic</a>\r\n\r\n</p></div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<br>",
